श्वेतदूर्व्वा|श्वेतदूर्वा
श्वेतदूर्व्वा<BR>f. (-र्व्वा)<BR>A bent grass with white blossoms.<BR>E.<BR>श्वेत, and टूर्व्वा Doob grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=WIL&page=868" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=wil" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्वेतद्विप|श्वेतद्विपः
श्वेतद्विप<BR>m. (-पः)<BR>1 A white elephant.<BR>2 INDRA'S elephant.<BR>E.<BR>श्वेत white, and द्विप an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=WIL&page=868" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=wil" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्वेतद्वीप|श्वेतद्वीपः
श्वेतद्वीप<BR>m. (-पः)<BR>The white island, or a minor division of the universe so called: also termed Candra Dvīpa, and supposed by WILFORD to be Britain.<BR>E.<BR>श्वेत white, and द्वीप an island; also श्वेत q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=WIL&page=868" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=wil" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्वेतधातु|श्वेतधातुः
श्वेतधातु<BR>m. (-तुः)<BR>1 Chalk.<BR>2 The milk stone, opal or chalcedony.<BR>E.<BR>श्वेत white, घातु a mineral.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=WIL&page=868" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=wil" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्वेतधामन्
श्वेतधामन्<BR>m. (-मा)<BR>1 The moon.<BR>2 Camphor.<BR>3 Cuttle fish bone.<BR>E.<BR>श्वेत white, and धामन् a ray.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=WIL&page=868" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=wil" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्वेतनील|श्वेतनीलः
श्वेतनील<BR>m. (-लः)<BR>A cloud.<BR>E.<BR>श्वेत white, and नील black or dark blue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=WIL&page=868" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=wil" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्वेतपत्र|श्वेतपत्रः
श्वेतपत्र<BR>m. (-त्रः)<BR>A goose.<BR>E.<BR>श्वेत white, and पत्र a feather.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=WIL&page=868" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=wil" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्वेतपत्ररथ|श्वेतपत्ररथः
