श्वेतरथ|श्वेतरथः
श्वेतरथ<BR>m. (-थः)<BR>The planet VENUS.<BR>E.<BR>श्वेत white, and रथ a car.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=WIL&page=868" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=wil" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्वेतरञ्जन|श्वेतरंजन|श्वेतरञ्जनं
