श्वेतरोचिस्
श्वेतरोचिस्<BR>m. (-चिः)<BR>The moon.<BR>E.<BR>श्वेत white, and रोचिस् light.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=WIL&page=868" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=wil" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्वेतरोहित|श्वेतरोहितः
श्वेतरोहित<BR>m. (-तः)<BR>GARUḌA.<BR>E.<BR>श्वेत white, and रोहित red.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=WIL&page=868" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=wil" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्वेतवचा
